    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seayooda weesa fuga mwaatkwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geagasayi danung'uneegwa hudiya siguura Foibe, was siida gadiyeesa ganiiseeda mida ng'eanyiida Gengreya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geagasayi gideaba gajadeapta aba gheawunga Ng'utamiida, gawuurji gidahaguuwda fuga ghaydidi, ak ghoaweachi aba ng'asheega wassean deepa gagasa aba heedeang'wa, aba gideaba niny niweat fuga saang'a ak ghaweadan eara aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghada Briska ea Akila, was fuga sin gadiyeeda sea aniini aba jeeda Gristo Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saawa ghayi ea hideadi eara ealajaada gheatkweaka nyaawa aba eaweegeasu, ak ea mii aniini gil ak ghwahit, eara ganiisajeega sean bea Eemoojiga ghoaghadeagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oakghada eara ganiiseeda mida jeedeaba gheanyi. Oakghada Epainetoheeda aabwariinyi, was siida madeeda mwas Gristo aba ng'eanyiida Asiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Mariyayda ghayi deawiit muuchi aba jeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Androniko sea Yuniya, was fuga eaduupcheewi ghayi siraduudayeewean; biissa ea nalaat aba jeeda giijasoodiga, nea saawa goosheedeawean nalooda Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Ampiliyatoheeda aabwariinyi aba jeeda Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Urbano, was siida easinuudayeewi aba jeeda Gristo ea Stakisiyda aabwariinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Apeleheeda was siida doabiiwaat aba jeeda Gristo. Ak gookeacheewi fuga gheeh Aristobulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Herodioni was siida eaduupcheewi, oakghada fuga gheeh Narkiso, mideayi sea Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada fuga gadiyeeda mida jeeda Ng'utamiida, was Drifaina ea Drifosa. Oakghada Bersisiyda aabwariinyi biissa gagadiiy muuchi aba heeda Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Rufo, was siida gadiyeeda haw bea Ng'utamiida, ea ghaamwat biissa ea iyya gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Asinkrito, Flegoni, Herme, Batroba, Herma, sea orjooga giyeanya mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada Filologo ea Yuliya, Nereya, sea huda ghaamwat, ea Olimpa, sea fuga sean ghaydidi mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada geat aba samita ghaydit. Ghoaghadeagwa ganiisajeega sean bea Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega huuydean bea gichea eabeada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea fuga eaduupcheewi, geamuscheegwa gideaba ang'ula fuga eatu jaleadinga ea ng'asheega jea gwaruusa buuneeda, mawoosa giinealshooda ghayi sinaleagwa; asi ooheeleewana geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga sina ng'asheesu magadiyeesiina Ng'utamiideanya was Gristo, saawa gagadiiyeesa jeesinga nyaawa, nea gaba geat aba ng'asheega nyaawa bea ng'uyeega iissa gwareengani gurooruunatka fuga manang'i fughareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba mureedeang'wa ninal buuneesean, ak geahoosanyi aba badahuukeagwa, ak geagasayi gideaba gajahuuwa fuga mideawa weaghuumeeda aba jeeda ng'asheega miyaas, nea ghoahuuyi fuga doobiiweadi aba ng'asheega munyas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ASEETA mideawa hoyyoo gaygabay ghwanung' adatasa Shataani aba geeshangeagwa. Dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo gagasa goobiida jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimoteoheeda was siida gadiyeeda sea aniini ghoaghadeagwa; sea Lukiyo, ea Yasoni ea Sospatroyda eaduupcheewi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniineeda was Dertiyo siida ng'oar barawajeanji gil, ghoaghadeagwa aba jeeda Ng'utamiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayoyda was siida eabareasi ea ganiiseesean ghoaghadeagwa. Erastoheeda was siida adiing'iida lapiya sea Gwarto, ghoaghadeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo gagasa goobiida jeedeang'wa oogasean. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mooshta ghawooda huuydean bea duumsheesiinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa siidida ammu goomajeegeegwean, aba giteascheata sea giijasteanyu miy ea gissirukwiideayda Yesu Gristo, ak gwadeaschi sea giidaheachta makcheameedida ghayi funyaat ng'eada deaghayi bea garayiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geatahaach ghamneawa aba ramooranga sing'waar amadu ghwanal eemoojiga, aba gidaghayi rukuteayda ASEETA manda muudeanooda, ak abeeda gwasin mureeda aba masaweega– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heeda ASEETA mideawa weaghuumeeda gagasa nyasa giigheambiita damanda manda muudeanooda aba naweeda Yesu Gristo! Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
